{
  "id": "fox-waveshine",
  "name": "Waveshine",
  "part": "tech",
  "characters": [
    "fox"
  ],
  "goal": "Shine, jump out of it, and wavedash.",
  "why": "A waveshine slides Fox along the ground while the opponent is still in the shine's hitstun, into range for an up smash, a grab or another shine. Done frame-perfectly, Fox can act again {16} frames after the shine came out.",
  "tutorial": {
    "camera": {
      "follow": "player",
      "distance": 90,
      "height": 8
    },
    "what": "A waveshine is a shine, a jump out of it on frame {4}, and an air dodge down and forward on frame {J+4}, the frame Fox leaves the ground. The air dodge drives Fox into the ground on that same frame, so he slides instead of rising.",
    "expect": "Each waveshine is judged when its landing lag ends: the frame of the jump, the frame Fox landed and how far he slid. After misses, the coach shows your inputs frame by frame against these frames.",
    "example": [
      {
        "stick": [
          0,
          -1
        ],
        "frame": 1
      },
      {
        "press": "B",
        "frame": 1
      },
      {
        "press": "jump",
        "frame": 4,
        "hold": 1
      },
      {
        "stick": [
          0.7,
          -0.7
        ],
        "frame": 7,
        "hold": 2
      },
      {
        "press": "R",
        "frame": 7,
        "hold": 2
      }
    ],
    "marks": {
      "1": "Frame 1: down-B. The hitbox and the intangibility last this frame only",
      "4": "Frame {4}: X pressed. The jump cancels the shine",
      "J+4": "Frame {J+4}: R and the stick down and forward. Fox lands at once",
      "J+13": "Frame {J+13}: the last frame of landing lag",
      "J+14": "Frame {J+14}: Fox can act"
    },
    "lessons": [
      {
        "title": "Jump out of the shine",
        "text": [
          "The shine comes out on the frame down-B is pressed, frame 1. Its hitbox and Fox's intangibility last that frame only, and frames {2} and {3} cannot be cancelled.",
          "From frame {4}, X or Y pressed while the shine is out cancels it into a jump. A jump pressed on frames 1 to {3} is ignored, and holding it does not carry it over to frame {4}: the press itself has to come on frame {4} or later."
        ],
        "show": {
          "example": {
            "inputs": [
              {
                "stick": [
                  0,
                  -1
                ],
                "frame": 1
              },
              {
                "press": "B",
                "frame": 1
              },
              {
                "press": "jump",
                "frame": 4,
                "hold": 1
              }
            ],
            "marks": {
              "1": "Frame 1: down-B. The shine comes out",
              "2": "Frame {f}: the shine. A jump pressed now is ignored",
              "4": "Frame {4}: X pressed. The jump cancels the shine",
              "5": "Frame {f}: the jump, still on the ground",
              "J+4": "Frame {J+4}: airborne"
            },
            "cues": [
              {
                "frames": [
                  1,
                  3
                ],
                "words": "Too soon: a jump is ignored",
                "kind": "late"
              },
              {
                "frames": [
                  4,
                  4
                ],
                "words": "Jump now",
                "kind": "go"
              },
              {
                "frames": [
                  5,
                  "J+3"
                ],
                "words": "Jump",
                "kind": "info"
              },
              {
                "frames": [
                  "J+4",
                  "J+30"
                ],
                "words": "Airborne",
                "kind": "info"
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "title": "Air dodge into the ground",
        "text": [
          "After a jump on frame {4}, Fox leaves the ground on frame {J+4}. An air dodge on that frame, stick down and forward, puts him back on the floor in the same frame. He slides through {10} frames of landing lag and can act on frame {J+14}.",
          "L or R pressed before Fox leaves the ground is ignored, and he jumps. A frame late, the air dodge starts higher and Fox lands {2} frames later."
        ],
        "show": {
          "example": {
            "inputs": [
              {
                "stick": [
                  0,
                  -1
                ],
                "frame": 1
              },
              {
                "press": "B",
                "frame": 1
              },
              {
                "press": "jump",
                "frame": 4,
                "hold": 1
              },
              {
                "stick": [
                  0.7,
                  -0.7
                ],
                "frame": 7,
                "hold": 2
              },
              {
                "press": "R",
                "frame": 7,
                "hold": 2
              }
            ],
            "marks": {
              "4": "Frame {4}: jump pressed out of the shine",
              "5": "Frame {f}: still on the ground. L or R now is ignored",
              "J+4": "Frame {J+4}: R and the stick down and forward. Fox lands",
              "J+5": "Frame {f}: sliding in landing lag",
              "J+14": "Frame {J+14}: free to act"
            },
            "cues": [
              {
                "frames": [
                  4,
                  "J+3"
                ],
                "words": "Too soon: an air dodge is ignored",
                "kind": "late"
              },
              {
                "frames": [
                  "J+4",
                  "J+4"
                ],
                "words": "Air dodge now",
                "kind": "go"
              },
              {
                "frames": [
                  "J+5",
                  "J+13"
                ],
                "words": "Landing lag: sliding",
                "kind": "info"
              },
              {
                "frames": [
                  "J+14",
                  "J+30"
                ],
                "words": "Free to act",
                "kind": "info"
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      }
    ]
  },
